-<main id="main"><div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/sell/">Sell</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Selling From Out of State</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Selling</p><h1 class="detail-h1">Sell your Grand Strand home from another state.<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">You do not have to come back.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 1, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Your Horry County home can sell while you stay in your own state. You sign the deed before a notary there, and the closing here goes ahead without you.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">None of the six steps needs you in South Carolina. We price and show the home, you sign the contract by e-signature, and a South Carolina attorney supervises the closing.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The buyer holds back part of the price for South Carolina income tax, unless it was your main home and the gain is inside the federal exclusion. For 2026, it is 5.21 percent of your gain if you sign the state's form, or of the whole price if you do not.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">About 3 in 10 buyers here are from another state, and we found no sign that they pay more than local buyers.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Live in another state? Get a price and a closing plan for your home.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Get my price and plan</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#sell-from-away" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Selling from away</a></li><li><a href="#withholding" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What the state holds back</a></li><li><a href="#price" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Where the price goes</a></li><li><a href="#disclosure" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Your disclosure</a></li><li><a href="#bookings" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Guest bookings</a></li><li><a href="#who-buys" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Who buys</a></li><li><a href="#selling-from-out-of-state-questions" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;li