 <div class="wrap">
 <div class="footer-cta" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1.2rem 2rem;padding-bottom:2.2rem;margin-bottom:2.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,239,232,.12)"><div style="max-width:600px"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--ivory);margin:0 0 .4rem;line-height:1.15">Ready to make your next move on the Grand Strand?</p><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.6);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.6;margin:0">Whether you are buying, selling, or investing, talk to a licensed local agent who knows the Grand Strand. No pressure, just straight answers.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Talk to an agent</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="tel:+18543332135" style="color:var(--ivory);border-color:rgba(244,239,232,.4)">Call 854.333.2135</a></div></div>
