+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 26-1-30.</span> Fee for issuance or renewal of commission.<br /><br />
+	The fee for the issuance or renewal of a commission is twenty-five dollars, collected by the Secretary of State as other fees.<br /><br />
