+	This chapter does not apply to:<br /><br />
+	(1) the sale, lease, or rental of real estate by an unlicensed owner of real estate who owns any interest in the real estate if the interest being sold, leased, or rented is identical to the owner&#39;s legal interest;<br /><br />
